DWM SETUP

Based on dwm 6.8.

PATCHES

Apply in numerical order.

  01  attachbottom
      New windows go to the bottom
      of the client list.

  02  gaps
      Add 5 pixel gaps between
      tiled windows.

  03  pertag
      Keep layout, master count,
      master size and bar visibility
      per tag.

  04  swaptags
      Swap two tags, including their
      saved per-tag settings.

  05  movestack
      Move the selected window up
      or down the stack.

  06  clock
      Show the date and time,
      including seconds, in the bar.

  07  config
      Set Super as the modifier
      and add the patch keybindings.


KEYBINDINGS

  Super replaces Alt in the
  default dwm keybindings.

  Super+Shift+j
      Move the selected window
      down the stack.

  Super+Shift+k
      Move the selected window
      up the stack.

  Alt+Shift+1-9
      Swap the current tag with
      the numbered tag.


CONFIGURATION

  Terminal: xterm
